  "prefLabel": "App 102.09 Registration of an apprenticeship agreement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "App 102.09 \"Registration of an apprenticeship agreement\" means the acceptance and recording of documents by the council as evidence of the participation of the apprentice in a particular registered apprenticeship program.\n\nSource. #6364-A, eff 10-29-96",
